{
  "slug": "very-good-ai-flutter-plugin",
  "name": "Very Good Ai Flutter Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Production-quality Flutter and Dart skills from Very Good Ventures. Provides opinionated, best-practice guidance for accessibility (WCAG 2.1), BLoC state management, testing\n(unit, widget, golden), Material 3 theming, GoRouter navigation, internationalization, layered architecture, static security (OWASP Mobile Top 10), and license compliance — plus\nautomated dart analyze and dart format hooks that run after every code edit. Skills activate automatically based on context or via slash commands.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**, **1 agent**, **3 hooks** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `accessibility` (Audit or remediate Flutter widgets against WCAG 2.2 accessibility conformance levels A, AA, or AAA across iOS, Android,…), `animations` (Best practices for Flutter animations using the built-in animation framework), `bloc` (Best practices for Bloc state management in Flutter/Dart), `create-project` (Scaffold a new Dart or Flutter project from a Very Good CLI template), `dart-flutter-sdk-upgrade` (VGV-specific reference for bumping Dart and Flutter SDK constraints across packages), `green-gate` (Drives a Dart or Flutter package to a fully green state through an autonomous verify-fix-rerun loop across four…), `internationalization` (Best practices for internationalization (i18n) and localization (l10n) in Flutter), `layered-architecture` (Best practices for VGV layered monorepo architecture in Flutter), and 7 more\n- **Agents** (1): `flutter-reviewer` (Read-only Flutter code reviewer)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (2): `dart`, `very-good-cli`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install very-good-ai-flutter-plugin@claude-community` from `VeryGoodOpenSource/very_good_ai_flutter_plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 15,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 3,
    "mcp": 2
